# Write a handover note

You start a week of leave tomorrow. A colleague will carry on one of your tasks while you are away. Write a short note that lets them continue without contacting you.

::: columns {width=wide}
:: {weight=3}
::: free-response Your handover note {private download=both}
placeholder: Name the task first
:::

:: {weight=2}
## Check your coverage

Tick each point your note covers. The ticks are your own judgment. They don't submit or grade your note, and you can change them at any time.

::: checklist Does your note cover these points?
- [ ] Which task it is and where its files are
- [ ] What is done and what is left
- [ ] The next deadline
- [ ] Who can help if something goes wrong
:::
:::
